## Crests, school names and marks

A crest, the name of a school, the name of an art and the name of a teacher
are identity, not software. Nothing in this repository grants any right to
use anyone's.

The generator ships with placeholders and draws its default crest from the
yotsume-bishi, a traditional Japanese kamon in the public domain. Whatever
you configure in its place is your own affair and your own responsibility.
